---
import StaticPage from '../layouts/StaticPage.astro';
---
<StaticPage
  title="Kontak"
  description="Hubungi tim Lofa — saran, koreksi, atau pertanyaan."
  path="/contact/"
>
  <h2>Hubungi kami</h2>
  <p>
    Punya saran topik, menemukan koreksi, atau sekadar ingin menyapa? Kirim pesan melalui email di bawah — kami baca
    dan balas sebisanya.
  </p>

  <p>
    <strong>Email:</strong>{' '}
    <a href="mailto:kontak@lofa.web.id?subject=Kontak%20Lofa">kontak@lofa.web.id</a>
  </p>

  <h2>Media sosial</h2>
  <p>Akun media sosial resmi belum tersedia. Halaman ini akan diperbarui saat sudah ada.</p>

  <h2>Formulir kontak</h2>
  <p>
    Isi formulir di bawah ini — pesan akan langsung dikirim ke kontak@lofa.web.id.
  </p>
  <form class="mt-6 space-y-4 rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-surface p-6 dark:border-line-dark dark:bg-surface-dark" action="https://formsubmit.co/kontak@lofa.web.id" method="POST" aria-label="Formulir kontak">
    <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Pesan dari halaman Kontak Lofa" />
    <input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" />
    <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false" />
    <div>
      <label for="contactName" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-ink dark:text-ink-dark">Nama</label>
      <input id="contactName" name="Nama" type="text" required class="w-full rounded-xl border border-line bg-canvas px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink outline-none focus:border-accent/50 dark:border-line-dark dark:bg-canvas-dark dark:text-ink-dark" placeholder="Nama kamu" />
    </div>
    <div>
      <label for="contactEmail" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-ink dark:text-ink-dark">Email</label>
      <input id="contactEmail" name="Email" type="email" required class="w-full rounded-xl border border-line bg-canvas px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink outline-none focus:border-accent/50 dark:border-line-dark dark:bg-canvas-dark dark:text-ink-dark" placeholder="email@contoh.com" />
    </div>
    <div>
      <label for="contactMessage" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-ink dark:text-ink-dark">Pesan</label>
      <textarea id="contactMessage" name="Pesan" rows="4" required class="w-full rounded-xl border border-line bg-canvas px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink outline-none focus:border-accent/50 dark:border-line-dark dark:bg-canvas-dark dark:text-ink-dark" placeholder="Tulis pesan kamu…"></textarea>
    </div>
    <button type="submit" class="rounded-full bg-ink px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-canvas transition hover:opacity-85 dark:bg-ink-dark dark:text-canvas-dark">Kirim</button>
    <p class="text-xs text-ink-faint">Pesan akan dikirim ke kontak@lofa.web.id.</p>
  </form>
</StaticPage>
